    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Rubric Reviewer\r\n\r\nThis bot will review your guide and check how well it meets the project rubric criteria.\r\n\r\n1. Click **Add File** and choose **From Library**.\r\n\r\n2. Select **Project Checklist**.\r\n\r\n3. Import your project from your **Backpack** and add it to the chat.\r\n\r\n4. Ask the Rubric Reviewer to check your project against the rubric.\r\n\r\n5. Read the feedback carefully and decide what you actually want to change.",
